WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:14.560
The seventh day is over.

00:14.560 --> 00:24.120
Now we come to the closing part of the Mahasapi Pathana Sutta.

00:24.120 --> 00:27.260
There are quite a few questions left.

00:27.260 --> 00:30.260
Let us see if you find some time for it.

00:42.260 --> 00:45.260
Chathu Sacha Pabbam

00:48.260 --> 00:53.260
The section of four noble truths.

00:53.260 --> 00:59.260
Punachaparan Bhikkave

